  "releaseNotes": "Adds opt-in field/property replication with per-member authority and a configurable game-state serializer. SocketJack binary formatting is the default. Includes UDP and TCP transport choices, Unity 6 primary support, a Unity 2022.3 LTS compatibility bracket, render-pipeline-independent networking and an expanded offline setup guide. Use matching builds, prefab schemas and serializer settings on every participant.",
